---
const { src, alt, title } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="infographic" aria-labelledby="infografia"><h2 id="infografia">Infografía del tema</h2><p>Esta infografía resume visualmente los conceptos estudiados. Puedes ampliarla o descargarla.</p><button class="open" type="button" data-open>Ampliar infografía</button><a class="download" href={`/${encodeURIComponent(src)}`} download={src}>Descargar PNG</a><img src={`/${encodeURIComponent(src)}`} alt={alt} width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" data-image><dialog aria-label={`Infografía ampliada: ${title}`}><button type="button" data-close>Cerrar</button><img src={`/${encodeURIComponent(src)}`} alt={alt}></dialog></section><script>document.querySelectorAll('.infographic').forEach((viewer)=>{const dialog=viewer.querySelector('dialog');const open=viewer.querySelector('[data-open]');const close=viewer.querySelector('[data-close]');open?.addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.showModal());close?.addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());dialog?.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{if(e.target===dialog)dialog.close()})})</script>
